            "fetched for a week it is a sentence about the past — and the harness row "
            "then measures a store path against a source tree that is behind it and "
            "reports the difference the wrong way round. That is why this fetches before "
            "it counts, and why a fetch that fails is an unknown rather than a pass."),
        briefs={
