                      "rest of this report is measured against it. Fast-forward it, then "
                      "re-run the whole doctor — rows that were computed against the old "
                      "tree may say something different against the new one."),
                constraints=(
                    "Fast-forward only: `git -C {repo} pull --ff-only`. A merge commit "
                    "nobody asked for is a worse outcome than a stale checkout.",
                    "If this is a worktree on a feature branch, being behind the default "
